# User Agent

After checking with the inspect element on the page, we found the following tag in the HTML code:
```html
<a href="?page=b7e44c7a40c5f80139f0a50f3650fb2bd8d00b0d24667c4c2ca32c88e13b758f"><li>© BornToSec</li></a>
```

After accessing this page, we found a page with text and music. We verified the HTML again using inspect element and found many comments. Two of them caught our attention:

<!--
You must come from : "https://www.nsa.gov/".
-->

<!--
Let's use this browser : "ft_bornToSec". It will help you a lot.
-->

We tested ft_bornToSec as a user agent to see what it returns:
```bash
curl \
-A "ft_bornToSec" \
-e "https://www.nsa.gov/" \
http://10.11.200.193/index.php?page=e43ad1fdc54babe674da7c7b8f0127bde61de3fbe01def7d00f151c2fcca6d1c
```

In the returned HTML code, we found the following line that gives us the flag:
```html
<h2 style="margin-top:50px;"> The flag is : f2a29020ef3132e01dd61df97fd33ec8d7fcd1388cc9601e7db691d17d4d6188</h2>
```